Always use Shadcn Sonner for all toast notifications and user feedback messages. Sonner provides accessible, theme-aware toast notifications that integrate seamlessly with the design system.

## Why Sonner?

- **Accessible**: Built-in ARIA support and screen reader compatibility
- **Theme-aware**: Automatically adapts to light/dark theme
- **Lightweight**: Minimal bundle size impact
- **Customizable**: Easy to customize icons and styling
- **Type-safe**: Full TypeScript support
- **Server Actions compatible**: Works perfectly with Server Actions and form submissions

